Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:20:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1184/1252] HERESY 1168: a run's clock through F5; a run
 brought back by F5 lands and plays; Clear takes the words, New song the rest;
 the meter's tags and empty sections; no void under the lifted form
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06–07.10.2026, the night:
- «Когда идёт генерация, счётчик тикает, но стоит во время генерации нажать F5, счётчик времени обнуляется»: the page keeps
  a run's start with the run (saveJobs); after an F5 the log's backlog replayed the start line and set it to now: a start
  the page kept now stands, and one it never saw is marked «~».
- «Play new takes вроде бы как перестал работать»: a run an F5 brought back while it still ran is this page's own again:
  it lands in the workspace in hand and plays when done (it was treated as a run that ended while the page was away). And
  the settings file heard of a change only every 4 s, so a setting turned back on and an F5 within them came back off: a
  change now goes out at once.
- «Кнопка Clear the Form очищает только формы? Не трогает LoRA и другие параметры? И чем она отличается от `Start new song`?
  Это нужно утрясти»: they did the same. Clear now takes the words (title, style, lyrics, score), both seeds and loaded codes;
  the mode, sampling, sliders, LoRAs, VAE and output stay. New song puts the machine back to its defaults too.
- «Блок Interlude не имеет текста под собою. Там счётчик не нужен»; «По примерам из YuE2 репо вычлени все возможные теги и
  предусмотри их»: a section with no words shows its name and no ruler. The 110 official examples' tags are known: the head
  of a tag (before –, —, -, :, |, /, a bracket) names the section («Verse 1 – Him», «Chorus: All», «Final Chorus / Outro»,
  «Instrumental Break - Horns», «副歌1», «主歌2», «桥段»); verse and bridge one group, pre-chorus, chorus (hook, refrain), post-chorus,
  intro, outro (end, fade out), interlude, break, drop, solo, instrumental each their own; a tag that names who sings
  («Male Vocals», «NARRATOR — NOT SUNG», «DRAGONZILLA — MONSTER VOX») or what the song is («MOOD: …», «TEMPO: …») is no section.
- «В композере в оверлее дохерища пустоты в подвале»: the meter's mirror laid out every line of the lyrics (87 lines,
  some 1,800 px) under the form and stretched the frame's scrolling; it is 0 tall now, its lines measured all the same.

The new words are English only, for the pass before 2.0.0 (Viktor: «Добавочные языки интерфейса давай в самую последнюю
очередь перед финальным релизом 2.0.0»). The suite: 370 passed, 0 failed (6 new checks); the mock's MOCK-HOLD runs a song
eight times slower, to reload under.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
